I believe carrying them is not very dangerous in nethack (unless you
break them yourself). You just should identify all that you can by
engraving or engraving and zapping (once you have determined it is
either make invisible or teleportation or cancellation) and avoid
putting an unidentified wand into your bag of holding. In slash'em
things are slightly different, as wands exploded, e.g., by lightning
hitting you or by zapping, if cursed, will also have the effects of
breaking them. A wand of cancellation or a wand of polymorph in your
inventory is a very bad thing...  (So you should also not try to
zap-identify the wand giving you the message "the writing vanishes!".
Chances of explosion of a cursed wand are much higher in slash'em than
in nethack.) Put them in a sack or stash them away somewhere.

